 "comment": "Matches sharing GUIDs, and no stock result. Two regular journals share qc-dup-a: they count once, the label is the later one's (JV-A2), and POP-5 reports the GUID. A regular journal (JV-B1) and a later cancelled one (JV-B2) share qc-dup-b: the regular one counts, and because its GUID is also an excluded voucher's, POP-4 reports the citation twice (once on the figure, once on the finding). A journal (JV-C1) and a later regular payment (PV-C2) share qc-dup-c: the journal still counts, and POP-5 reports the GUID. The count is 3; the module check walks voucher by voucher, finds 4 and fires.",
